ap=\"type\"><span class=\"style-apple-chip\"><b style=\"font-size:13px;color:#1d1d1f;letter-spacing:-.5px\">Aa</b>大字紧字距</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"space\"><span class=\"style-apple-chip\"><i style=\"background:#fff;border:1px dashed #dcdce0\"></i>充足留白</span></span>\n    </span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"display:inline-flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"corner\"><span class=\"style-apple-chip\"><i style=\"background:#f0f0f2;border:1px solid #dcdce0;border-radius:8px\"></i>Large rounded corner 16-28px</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"glass\"><span class=\"style-apple-chip\"><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(120deg,#7c3aed,#e0396b);position:relative\"><b style=\"position:absolute;inset:2px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.5)\"></b></i>Frosted glass</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"shadow\"><span class=\"style-apple-chip\"><i style=\"background:#fff;border:none;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.1),0 6px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.12)\"></i>Layered soft shadow</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"grad\"><span class=\"style-apple-chip\"><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0090e3,#7d4fe0,#e0396b)\"></i>Gradient accent</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"type\"><span class=\"style-apple-chip\"><b style=\"font-size:13px;color:#1d1d1f;letter-spacing:-.5px\">Aa</b>Large fonts with tight kerning</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"space\"><span class=\"style-apple-chip\"><i style=\"background:#fff;border:1px dashed #dcdce0\"></i>Generous whitespace</span></span>\n    </span>","parts":[{"key":"corner","cn":"连续圆角","en":"Corner","desc":"示例使用较大圆角；实际半径要跟随卡片、按钮和图标尺寸","desc_en":"Use generous corner radii consistently across cards, buttons, and icons."},{"key":"glass","cn":"半透明材质","en":"Material","desc":"导航与浮层可以透出环境色，但要保证对比度和无模糊时的可读性","desc_en":"Translucent surfaces can borrow color from the background, but text and controls still need sufficient contrast."},{"key":"shadow","cn":"分层软阴影","en":"Shadow","desc":"近处边界与远处柔影共同表达悬浮关系，数值不是固定配方","desc_en":"A crisp edge and soft shadow create visual elevation; tune them to the component and surrounding surface."},{"key":"grad","cn":"渐变点缀","en":"Gradient","desc":"用于强调或材质光感，范围应由内容和对比度决定","desc_en":"Use gradients sparingly to add emphasis or suggest material depth, while preserving contrast."},{"key":"type","cn":"大标题","en":"Type","desc":"标题可以更大、更紧凑，但中英文应分别测试字距和换行","desc_en":"Large, tightly set display type can create impact; test tracking and line breaks separately in Chinese and English."},{"key":"space","cn":"聚焦留白","en":"Space","desc":"用留白突出当前卖点，同时保留下一步操作和必要说明","desc_en":"Use generous whitespace to focus attention while keeping the next step and essential context visible."}]},"use":[{"t":"产品发布页，重点展示少量核心优势和产品图","m":"style-apple-use-launch"},{"t":"强调工艺与体验，并有真实产品细节支撑","m":"style-apple-use-premium"},{"t":"已经具备高质量图片、视频或渲染素材","m":"style-apple-use-photo"},{"t":"消费级产品介绍，需要展示关键界面和设备适配","m":"style-apple-use-app"}],"dont":[{"t":"数据密集工具使用过大留白，降低扫描效率","m":"style-apple-dont-dense","bad":true},{"t":"同时堆叠毛玻璃、大圆角和强渐变","m":"style-apple-dont-blur","bad":true},{"t":"素材质量不足，却依赖视觉效果掩盖内容","m":"style-apple-dont-cheap","bad":true},{"t":"表单字段间距过大，破坏连续阅读和填写","m":"style-apple-dont-form","bad":true}],"principles":[{"t":"<b>每个视区先确定一个重点</b>：留白服务于聚焦和节奏，不是单纯把内容拉得很散","m":"style-apple-space"},{"t":"<b>圆角与组件尺寸成比例</b>：大卡片可以更圆，小控件要保证边界和点击区域清楚","m":"style-apple-corner"},{"t":"<b>毛玻璃只在需要看见背景关系的浮层使用</b>：同时保证对比度，并准备关闭模糊时仍可读的背景","m":"style-apple-glass"},{"t":"<b>阴影表达前后层级</b>：近层边界清楚，悬浮层可以更柔和；数值要根据背景现场调试","m":"style-apple-shadow"},{"t":"<b>渐变承担明确作用</b>：可以点出关键词或材质光感，但不要牺牲文字可读性","m":"style-apple-grad"}],"demoDetail":"<div class=\"style-apple-demo apple-studio\">\n    <header class=\"apple-menu\"><b><i class=\"ti ti-apple\"></i></b><span>Orbit Studio</span><span>Discover</span><span>Library</span><i></i><button>Share <i class=\"ti ti-upload\"></i></button><b class=\"apple-profile\">L</b></header>\n    <div class=\"apple-toolbar\"><span class=\"apple-traffic\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><b>Chromatic veil</b><span>Edited just now</span><i></i><button><i class=\"ti ti-slider-horizontal\"></i></button><button><i class=\"ti ti-sparkles\"></i></button></div>\n    <main class=\"apple-canvas\"><img src=\"/assets/style-imagery/apple-glass-ribbons.webp\" alt=\"Pastel glass ribbon wallpaper\"><span class=\"apple-crop crop-a\"></span><span class=\"apple-crop crop-b\"></span><div class=\"apple-inspector\"><header><b>Adjust</b><i class=\"ti ti-x\"></i></header><label>Brilliance <span>+18</span><i><b style=\"width:61%\"></b></i></label><label>Warmth <span>−6</span><i><b style=\"width:42%\"></b></i></label><label>Definition <span>+12</span><i><b style=\"width:55%\"></b></i></label><footer>Auto <button>Done</button></footer></div></main>\n    <footer class=\"apple-film\"><button><i class=\"ti ti-chevron-left\"></i></button><img src=\"/assets/style-imagery/apple-blue-organic.webp\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"on\" src=\"/assets/style-imagery/apple-glass-ribbons.webp\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"/assets/style-imagery/apple-blue-organic.webp\" style=\"object-position:76% 50%\" alt=\"\"><button><i class=\"ti ti-chevron-right\"></i></button></footer>\n  </div>","prompt":"做一个消费电子产品页。每一屏聚焦一个用户能感知的核心特点，用产品画面和简短说明支撑它；导航和购买入口保持轻量、易找。产品参数和效果只用现有可核验资料，缺少的先标“待补充”，不要自己编。","prompt_en":"Premium product page with generous whitespace, one focused message per screen, frosted-glass navigation, 16–28px continuous corner radius, layered soft shadows, restrained gradient accents, large headlines with tight tracking","references":[{"title":"人机界面指南","source":"Apple HIG","url":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines","title_en":"Human Interface Guidelines"}],"scenes":["消费电子产品发布页","系统级毛玻璃窗口","App 分发详情页","穿戴设备健康页"],"en":{"prompt":"Premium product page with generous whitespace, one focused message per screen, frosted-glass navigation, 16–28px continuous corner radius, layered soft shadows, restrained gradient accents, large headlines with tight tracking","use":[{"t":"Hardware or premium product launch","m":"style-apple-use-launch"},{"t":"A focused feature story","m":"style-apple-use-premium"},{"t":"A brand with strong original imagery","m":"style-apple-use-photo"},{"t":"A page that can support careful art direction","m":"style-apple-use-app"}],"dont":[{"t":"Copy Apple's assets or interface details","m":"style-apple-dont-dense","bad":true},{"t":"Use huge headings when the content is weak","m":"style-apple-dont-blur","bad":true},{"t":"Hide basic information behind scroll effects","m":"style-apple-dont-cheap","bad":true},{"t":"Apply glossy surfaces to an unrelated product","m":"style-apple-dont-form","bad":true}],"principles":[{"t":"Give each section one clear message","m":"style-apple-space"},{"t":"Use large type with disciplined line length and spacing","m":"style-apple-corner"},{"t":"Let product imagery explain real form and behavior","m":"style-apple-glass"},{"t":"Keep controls familiar and visually precise","m":"style-apple-shadow"},{"t":"Use motion to connect states, not to delay the story","m":"style-apple-grad"}],"scenes":["Product launch","Feature story","Hardware page","Premium service"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;background:#f5f5f7;border:1px solid #eeeef2;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;padding:9px 18px;font-size:12px;color:#55555b;background:rgba(255,255,255,.72);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(16px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.05)\"><b style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;color:#1d1d1f;font-size:14px\"><i class=\"ti ti-aperture\"></i>Aera</b><span>Product</span><span>Design</span><span>Support</span><i class=\"ti ti-search\" style=\"margin-left:auto\"></i><i class=\"ti ti-shopping-bag\"></i></div>\n      <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:.88fr 1.12fr;gap:20px;padding:22px 22px 18px;align-items:center\">\n   